/* hook_res.rc -- embeds this board's own RENDERING hook into
 * ultra_sega_europar.dll as RCDATA, so exactly one file ships/gets signed for
 * the injected-hook part of this board (the separate dinput8.CRK.dll
 * controls proxy is a file-swap mechanism, not injected, and stays a
 * standalone file -- see sega_europar_main.c's header, point 2). Built by
 * build_module.sh AFTER src/hook/build_europar_hook.sh produces the hook
 * binary. Extracted back out at runtime by extract_hook_to_temp() in
 * sega_europar_main.c. See docs/PROJECT_LICENSING_AND_SIGNING.md.
 *
 * 32-bit only.
 */
HOOK32 RCDATA "hook/ultra_sega_europar_hook32.dll"
